   "npc": null,
   "page": 4,
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Human",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Stonemasons out of Stormwind, he took advantage of the relatively unprotected state of Westfall, and used his considerable manpower to run many of the farmers off, and take over the handful of gold mines.\r\n\r\nTaking advantage of the resources at his disposal, VanCleef hatched a plan of retribution against the government of Stormwind.\r\n\r\nThis information came to light recently with the assistance of the bearer of this document, who was instrumental in shedding light on this vast conspiracy.",
   "time": 1791904415,
   "title": "Report on the Defias Brotherhood",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Stormwind City"
  }
 },
 "gossip": {
