  "251684|3fc9c33a": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Strange Hermit",
   "npc": "251684",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Oh, these things? I built them. My little friends helped me. I'm not very good at remembering things, but, um, I do know that at one point I used to build a lot of things. Big things! But then, like I said... I was here. The things I build aren't so big and impressive anymore. Still makes me h-happy, heh.\r\n\r\nB-but... If you want, I can show you how to build things too!",
   "time": 1791905287,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251684|5d8faa22": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Strange Hermit",
   "npc": "251684",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "H-Hello. You'll have to excuse me, I'm used to your kind running from me.",
   "time": 1791906162,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251684|f390af9b": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Strange Hermit",
   "npc": "251684",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "That is... a very good question. I have a hard time remembering things, but I do remember something... \"Engineer\", perhaps? I think that's what, or who, I was.\r\n\r\nOther than that, all I can seem to remember is soaring through the sky, then seeing a flash of lightning before things got very bumpy. Then... a crash.\r\n\r\nIt's been... a long time though. A very long time.",
   "time": 1791906163,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "251684|ff48bdd6": {
   "build": "70450",
   "class": "Druid",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Strange Hermit",
   "npc": "251684",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Oh, that's okay. I-I'll be here if you want to learn some other time. T-Thank you for talking to me!",
   "time": 1791905289,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
