   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "You've earned a degree of trust amongst the Nightclaw, $c. We don't have much to offer you as a reward, but we have managed to scavenge a number of crafting plans from the ruins of Ban'aethal.\r\n\r\nThe magesmiths of Ban'aethal were widely regarded to be the best artisans in all of the $R Isles. The Nightclaw are naturalists, not crafters, so these records are of little use to us.\r\n\r\nContinue to prove yourself to be a valuable ally, and I would make these secrets available to you.",
   "time": 1791907935,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
